# Web build (served from the same Vercel project as the API): leave unset,
# requests go to the relative "/api" path on the same origin.
#
# Native builds (Android/Windows) have no same-origin backend — set this to
# your deployed API before building:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-app.vercel.app/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
